{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Those who look outside, sleeps. Those who look inside, awakens.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>HYPNOSTASIS</strong> is a survival horror shooter that plunges you into the twisted nightmares of a fractured mind. You awaken in your room to an unsettling world of disturbing creatures. The world you know has warped into something sinister. Find your way through the unknown as your sanity slowly slips away. You'll navigate nightmarish landscapes, uncover buried memories, and confront the shadows.\u00a0Will you lose yourself to madness and delusion, or confront the truth and find salvation?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.poster.avif?t=1753285503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.webm?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/4793a5764061f6c43820684266647c12.mp4?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.poster.avif?t=1753285503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.webm?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/d6962baf41f12fe2b922a3d138ec6857.mp4?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.poster.avif?t=1753285503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.webm?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/extras/8a2022e9c4891e6faa3007a86e952b97.mp4?t=1753285503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 10 hours of single-player content. *Demo contains ~3hrs of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore an expansive landscape of eerie, dreamlike, and unsettling worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Semi-open world level design that allows a high freedom of exploration.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">High-stake combat that puts you on the edge and requires you to use your resources carefully.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your playstyle with a wide range of weapons and equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inventory management and crafting system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sanity system that adds to the tension.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different endings depending on your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Movement system similar to early Goldsrc titles and developer console.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Connections to analytical psychology.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825440?t=1753285503","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3825440?t=1753285503","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825440/806ef4188b8f4bd7d6aafc1061e2f6d3f48fb030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753285503","capsule_image